{"symbol":"AMBOAGRI","yahoo":"AMBOAGRI.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Ambo Agritec Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","website":"https://www.amboagritec.com","about":"Ambo Agritec Limited manufactures and sells biscuits in India. The company offers biscuits and cookies under the HAPPY BITE brand name; refined soya bean oil, mustard oil, rice bran oil, sunflower oil, and vegetable oil under the Happy Heart brand name vanaspati oil under the Ambo Gold and Vanaspati 2000 brand names; and Bengali specialty products under the Max Health brand name. It also offers various tea products; and chips and extruded snacks. In addition, the company offers in wooden flooring and interior wall-related businesses. Further, it provides trading of crude linseed oil and soyabean meal. The company was formerly known as AMBO Agritec Private Limited. Ambo Agritec Limited was incorporated in 1994 and is based in Kolkata, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:07:49+00:00","quote":{"price":10.39,"prevClose":10.02,"marketCap":20.62,"high52":66.79,"low52":8.62,"pe":35.83,"bookValue":27.35,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":1.02,"shares":1.9845,"insiders":76.3,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2022-12-02","2022-12-05","2022-12-06","2022-12-07","2022-12-08","2022-12-09","2022-12-12","2022-12-13","2022-12-14","2022-12-15","2022-12-16","2022-12-19","2022-12-20","2022-12-21","2022-12-22","2022-12-23","2022-12-26","2022-12-27","2022-12-28","2022-12-29","2022-12-30","2023-01-02","2023-01-03","2023-01-04","2023-01-05","2023-01-06","2023-01-09","2023-01-10","2023-01-11","2023-01-12","2023-01-13","2023-01-16","2023-01-17","2023-01-18","2023-01-19","2023-01-20","2023-01-23","2023-01-24","2023-01-25","2023-01-27","2023-01-30","2023-01-31","2023-02-01","2023-02-02","2023-02-03","2023-02-06","2023-02-07","2023-02-08","2023-02-09","2023-02-10","2023-02-13","2023-02-14","2023-02-15","2023-02-16","2023-02-17","2023-02-20","2023-02-21","2023-02-22","2023-02-23","2023-02-24","2023-02-2